    <item>
      <title>亿万富翁普拉达氏族继承计划由Versace Deal提高</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几十年来，凶猛独立的Prada Spa董事长Patrizio Bertelli谈到了意大利时装屋需要获得规模和规模，以占领LVMH和Kering SA等庞大的行业庞然大物，并避免被他们吞噬。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>欧洲公司库存，转移生产到支撑关税</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/european-firms-stockpile-shift-production-to-brace-for-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）现在退出了他最陡峭的关税。但是，随着其他职责仍然存在，在美国开展业务将使欧盟公司变得更加昂贵。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/european-firms-stockpile-shift-production-to-brace-for-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>完整：瑞士总统特朗普关税，瑞银银行上限</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-12/in-full-swiss-president-on-trump-tariffs-ubs-bank-cap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[瑞士总统兼财政部长卡林·凯勒·席特（Karin Keller-Sutter）谈到了美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）对瑞士的31％关税。她在华沙对彭博的奥利弗·克鲁克（Oliver Crook）讲话时还讨论了瑞士国家银行和瑞银集团（UBS Group AG）在其投资银行规模的永久性上的独立性。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-12/in-full-swiss-president-on-trump-tariffs-ubs-bank-cap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 06:03:17 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普在暂停关税之前就承诺瑞士人几个小时</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/trump-made-promise-to-swiss-just-hours-before-suspending-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）承诺，瑞士对手将在她的国家暂停世界上的大部分关税袭击之前，再次看她的国家征收的税款。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/trump-made-promise-to-swiss-just-hours-before-suspending-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>匈牙利在ORBAN支出计划上推到S＆amp; p的垃圾边缘</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/hungary-pushed-to-edge-of-junk-at-s-p-on-orban-s-spending-plans</link>
      <description><![CDATA[匈牙利的主权信用级前景从S＆amp; p全球评级降低到负面，这将国家推向了总理维克多·奥尔班（Viktor Orban）提高选举前支出后，将国家推向了垃圾的边缘。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/hungary-pushed-to-edge-of-junk-at-s-p-on-orban-s-spending-plans</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 21:23:20 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>意大利的评级由S＆amp; P升级为Meloni的另一场胜利</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/italy-wins-s-p-s-credit-rating-upgrade-in-another-win-for-meloni</link>
      <description><![CDATA[意大利的评级由S＆amp; p Global Ratings＆Mdash升级；信用评估师的第三个这样的赞誉，预计该国公共财政的改善。]]></description>
